[{"client_msg_id":"2cc2dde5-af8b-4318-bb54-ed7dc073b65a","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"カード番号と暗証番号を入力させられて、しかも暗証番号を1回間違えてしまって面倒だなと思ったのと、自動ガイダンスの選択肢が最後だったので最後まで聞かないと選択できないとか、フリーダイヤルじゃないとか気になる点はあったけどまあ許容範囲でした。","ts":"1621227333.251500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zeFN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56cc6bc4-5e77-4f94-8bcb-acbb2d388b49","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"携帯からだとフリーダイヤルじゃないのもつらいですね。。。今どき固定電話なんかないよ・・・","ts":"1621226875.248700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dYpzU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"216f539e-4ab2-4025-a55c-31bec983787a","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"今回は自動ガイダンス4ステップほど+待ち数秒+オペレーターとお話し1, 2分ほどだったか。フリーダイヤルじゃなかったので150~200円分ぐらいかかったのかな。","ts":"1621226819.247600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ewg9U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"528fac00-82e7-48df-bb34-1e98f4165543","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"メルマガの解約できないやつ本当につらい","ts":"1621226817.247500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2DRT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"754bcf67-af6d-488a-a5ac-e730c8dc50b0","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"意外と旧来のインフラ（電気・ガス・水道）の方がそこらへん頑張ってたりするな〜\n（UIしょぼかったりするけど）","ts":"1621226743.246900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GKN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdf79e32-6fba-4e55-8908-4065efd5cdd6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"メルマガを解除すると記事が読めなくなるサービス。。","ts":"1621226673.245800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HKkv="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce4f2306-8bc2-41cd-bb8f-8578aba848a4","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"逆に退会も全部オンラインで