んかすごくイメージがよくなったから次乗り換えるときも利用したいと思った。","ts":"1621225779.239500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cUT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b4ee4e8-3e8a-4c08-b8a9-42c0b641ae91","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"この前新しいクレカを作ってしまったので、ようやくやる気を出した","ts":"1621225535.236400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eag"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3802a893-c887-4b03-8743-3b9afbd727ad","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"退会がバックログの優先度低になるのは必然ですよね・・・きちんと実装してるところ偉い","ts":"1621225088.235500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6YfS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fc256c6-a72e-496a-ac67-3c0493b1dea4","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"何年にもわたって全然使ってなかったクレカ、ようやく解約した。平日の日中に電話しないといけないというのが面倒でなかなかやる気が出なかった。","ts":"1621224999.234400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":8,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U776661HA","UFHQ7TNT0","U06BRP8VD","U782D5DF1","UL6CFN8NR","U01BY3SDBRS","UQX22KG9F"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"14f"}]}]
